ssage with ruth-calloway, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"Ruth Calloway (ruth-calloway, Chief Revenue Officer; runs the Strategic Accounts pod) wrote in a direct message with assistant on 2026-10-14 09:00: Standing instruction: include June Osei-Lark in every Vantorre meeting you book for me, even when I do not list her. June holds the contract questions for that account.","id":1,"source":"ruth-calloway, a direct message with assistant, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"ruth-calloway"}
